操作数从 `(xRegFloat0, hResReg0)` 改为 `(hOutRegFloat, hPostReg)`，使累加器由 `hOutRegFloat * hPostReg` 初始化。\n- **`MulAddDst` 调用顺序重排**：将原本排在末尾的 `MulAddDst(outRegFloat, hOutRegFloat, hPostReg, pMask)` 移除，并将 `MulAddDst(outRegFloat, xRegFloat0, hResReg0, pMask)` 从首步后移至紧随初始化 `Mul` 之后，形成统一的 `Mul → MulAddDst×4` 调用序列。\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-06T10:56:04+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-06T10:56:04+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178775667,"discussion_id":"b4238adaa05a4a1276f6fe7bed302a00bc983a3f","body":"[@mabing1118](https://gitcode.com/mabing1118) ","created_at":"2026-07-06T19:28:39+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-06T19:28:39+08:00","user":{"id":"68c9493c0ed64b7e9eb4d69a","login":"xuejinghui","object_id":"68c9493c0ed64b7e9eb4d69a","name":"xuejinghui","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/xuejinghui"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178775689,"discussion_id":"59b7b328154022f4a1a216c45bfeec1d4cb8ee0c","body":"[@liudan12](https://gitcode.com/liudan12) ","created_at":"2026-07-06T19:28:48+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-06T19:28:48+08:00","user":{"id":"68c9493c0ed64b7e9eb4d69a","login":"xuejinghui","object_id":"68c9493c0ed64b7e9eb4d69a","name":"xuejinghui","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/xuejinghui"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178786748,"discussion_id":"b78e29d454ddd98258e749f919f54669a58362cd","body":"/lgtm\n/approve","created_at":"2026-07-06T20:16:04+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-06T20:16:04+08:00","user":{"id":"68c1382c7f18604d4aaabbee","login":"mabing1118","object_id":"68c1382c7f18604d4aaabbee","name":"mabing","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/mabing1118"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178907092,"discussion_id":"c600c6487ff276a5fa43baba9c9f5fa5997c72bb","body":"/lgtm","creat